From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Stoffel <stoffel.thomas.ryan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 03:00:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chat: center the empty thread on a heading

A session provider can supply a heading and placeholder and hide the
workspace and session-type picker row. wisp uses that for the empty
thread (#298).

